(text "AC METERING. Hot side GND_AC isolated by ISOW7841 (data+power) + ISO7741, both 5kVrms reinforced, SOIC-16W 8mm. Barrier keep-out >=8mm + slot.\nVoltage: fully differential. Each line 4x1M -> tap (1k to GND_AC); each neutral (GEN_N, BUS_N separately) 4x1M -> N_TAP (1k to GND_AC); VxN <- 1k <- N_TAP.\nNo 0R neutral link: GND_AC floats at the divider mid-point, common-mode attenuated 4001:1. Current: AC1005 CTs, burden 2x24.9R." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 12 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "36a6e1ab-fe88-44cf-9242-ad4498d150a9"))
)
